{"id":"646196","name":"炒濑粉","author":"琪_feXjZ8E2","authorId":"10602029","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/646196/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"濑粉","amount":"250克"},{"name":"韭菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"绿豆芽","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜末","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备:濑粉。","img":"images/646196/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"韭菜。","img":"images/646196/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"绿豆芽。","img":"images/646196/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"腌制好的肉片，蒜末。","img":"images/646196/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"先处理濑粉，用开水把濑粉过一下，主要是把濑粉弄得条条分明，濑粉本身就是熟的。","img":"images/646196/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"然后沥干水。","img":"images/646196/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"添加点酱油，油。","img":"images/646196/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"拌均匀，等下炒的时候就很清爽条条分明不会粘贴。","img":"images/646196/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"热锅放油，下蒜末爆香。","img":"images/646196/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放肉片炒香，然后先铲出备用。","img":"images/646196/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"锅里还有底油，放入韭菜，绿豆芽大火翻炒。","img":"images/646196/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"断生后调少许盐翻匀。","img":"images/646196/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"再放入濑粉。","img":"images/646196/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"肉片回锅。","img":"images/646196/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"快速翻炒一分钟左右就可以了。","img":"images/646196/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/646196/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/646196/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}